{"id": "16-1817-2-9", "zh": "Hū、bhū，用于“存在”的意义：hoti、bhavati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1817-10-13", "zh": "Pahoti、pabhavati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1817-14-16", "zh": "“朋友，或许会有。”（huveyya pāvuso）", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1817-17-20", "zh": "“如果会有生起的话。”（sace uppādo heyya）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1817-21-28", "zh": "“夜叉战胜了人中最杰出的英雄，那里响起了巨大而喧闹的声音。”", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1817-29-34", "zh": "“这棵芒果树从前曾经是这样。”（ambā’yaṃ ahuvā pure）", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1817-35-38", "zh": "“从前有一位毗提诃人的国王。”（ahu rājā videhānaṃ）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1817-39-43", "zh": "“帝释啊，我有很多财富。”（pahūtaṃ me dhanaṃ sakka）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1817-44-47", "zh": "“圣者造作了许多福德。”（pahūtamariyo pakaroti puññaṃ）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1817-48-50", "zh": "“财富丰厚的人。”（pahūtavitto puriso）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1817-51-53", "zh": "“具有广长舌的世尊。”（pahūtajivho bhagavā）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1817-54-57", "zh": "“争吵和争论都是从所爱而生的。”（piyappabhūtā kalahā vivādā）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1817-58-60", "zh": "“应当担任随从沙门。”（pacchāsamaṇena hotabbaṃ）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1817-61-62", "zh": "Bhavitabbaṃ（应当成为）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1817-63-68", "zh": "Hotuṃ、hetuye、bhavituṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1817-69-72", "zh": "Hutvā、hutvāna。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1817-73-76", "zh": "Bhavitvā、bhavitvāna。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1818-2-21", "zh": "这里，“atthi hehiti so maggo, na so sakkā na hetuye”（那条道路存在，也将会存在，它不可能不存在）是圣典中的例证。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1818-22-26", "zh": "其中，**nahetuye**是“不存在”（abhavituṃ）的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1818-27-44", "zh": "应当理解为：从 hū 词根，把 tuṃ 词缀或 tave 词缀替换成 tuye，并把 ū 音替换成 e 音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1818-45-52", "zh": "或者，也可以理解为“不可能不成为原因”的意思。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-1818-53-65", "zh": "不过这里要取的不是这个意思，要取的只是前一个意思，因为所举的这个词是为了说明这个词根的用法。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1818-66-78", "zh": "其中，**pahotī**的意思是：这块布因为宽大，足够做一件袈裟，不是不够。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1818-79-86", "zh": "或者，**pahotī**是说：这个人能够战胜敌人。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1818-87-92", "zh": "或者，**pahotī**就是 hoti（存在）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1818-93-96", "zh": "**pabhavatī**是“流出”的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1818-97-103", "zh": "Pahūtaṃ 是宽广、巨大的意思。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1818-104-108", "zh": "**pahūtavitto**是财富丰厚、拥有大量财富的意思。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1818-109-117", "zh": "**pahūtajivho**是舌头非常宽、非常长、非常柔软的意思；**piyappabhūtā**是从所爱而生的意思。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1819-2-5", "zh": "Gamu、sappa，用于“行走”的意义。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1819-6-35", "zh": "Gacchati、gamati、ghammati、āgacchati、uggacchati、atigacchati、paṭigacchati、avagacchati、adhigacchati、anugacchati、upagacchati、apagacchati、vigacchati、nigacchati、niggacchati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1819-36-38", "zh": "其他的形式也应当依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1819-39-49", "zh": "也应当像“samuggacchati”等那样，按两个前缀连用的方式，依实际可能来组合。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1819-50-55", "zh": "Sappati、saṃsappati、parisappati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1819-56-58", "zh": "其他的形式也应当依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1820-2-6", "zh": "其中，**gamatī**就是 gacchati（去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1820-7-18", "zh": "在使役形式中，有“devadattaṃ gameti、gamayati”（使提婆达多去）这样的形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1820-19-29", "zh": "“apāyaṃ gametīti apāyagamanīyaṃ”（使人去往恶道，所以称为导向恶道的）是这里的例证。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1820-30-50", "zh": "这个词根归入 curādi 类、前面加上 ā 时，有“āgameti、āgamayati、āgamento、āgamayamāno”这些单纯主动形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1821-2-8", "zh": "其中，**āgametī**是“稍等片刻”的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1821-9-12", "zh": "**ghammatī**就是 gacchati（去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-13-16", "zh": "**āgacchatī**是“来”（āyāti）的意思。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-17-22", "zh": "**uggacchatī**是升起，向上去。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-23-27", "zh": "**atigacchatī**是越过而去。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-28-32", "zh": "**paṭigacchatī**是再次去。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1821-33-36", "zh": "**avagacchatī**是知道。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-37-42", "zh": "**adhigacchatī**是获得，或者知道。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-43-47", "zh": "**anugacchatī**是跟在后面走。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1821-48-52", "zh": "**upagacchatī**是走近。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1821-53-56", "zh": "**apagacchatī**是离开。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-57-60", "zh": "**vigacchatī**是离去、消失。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1821-61-64", "zh": "**nigacchatī**是获得。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-65-75", "zh": "“yasaṃ poso nigacchati”（人获得名声）是这里的例证。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1821-76-79", "zh": "**niggacchatī**是出去。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1821-80-83", "zh": "**sappatī**是行走。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1821-84-88", "zh": "**saṃsappatī**是辗转移动着行走。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1821-89-93", "zh": "**parisappatī**是四处行走。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1822-2-12", "zh": "现在，为了让有智慧的人对三藏佛语及其义注产生极高的熟练，我们来讲述连同用法的词形变化表。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1822-13-14", "zh": "就是：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1822-15-22", "zh": "So gacchati（他去），te gacchanti、gacchare（他们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1822-23-28", "zh": "Tvaṃ gacchasi（你去），tumhe gacchatha（你们去）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1822-29-34", "zh": "Ahaṃ gacchāmi（我去），mayaṃ gacchāma（我们去）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1822-35-40", "zh": "So gacchate（他去），te gacchante（他们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1822-41-46", "zh": "Tvaṃ gacchase（你去），tumhe gacchavhe（你们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1822-47-52", "zh": "Ahaṃ gacche（我去），mayaṃ gacchāmhe（我们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1822-53-55", "zh": "以上是现在时的形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1823-2-7", "zh": "So gacchatu（让他去），te gacchantu（让他们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1823-8-17", "zh": "Tvaṃ gacchāhi、gaccha、gacchassu（你去吧），tumhe gacchatha（你们去吧）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1823-18-23", "zh": "Ahaṃ gacchāmi（让我去），mayaṃ gacchāma（让我们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1823-24-29", "zh": "So gacchataṃ（让他去），te gacchantaṃ（让他们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1823-30-35", "zh": "Tvaṃ gacchassu（你去吧），tumhe gacchavho（你们去吧）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1823-36-41", "zh": "Ahaṃ gacche（让我去），mayaṃ gacchāmase（让我们去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1823-42-44", "zh": "以上是命令语气（pañcamī）的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1824-2-10", "zh": "So gaccheyya、gacche（他应当去），te gaccheyyuṃ（他们应当去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1824-11-16", "zh": "Tvaṃ gaccheyyāsi（你应当去），tumhe gaccheyyātha（你们应当去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1824-17-24", "zh": "Ahaṃ gaccheyyāmi（我应当去），mayaṃ gaccheyyāma、gacchemu（我们应当去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1824-25-30", "zh": "So gacchetha（他应当去），te gaccheraṃ（他们应当去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1824-31-36", "zh": "Tvaṃ gacchetho（你应当去），tumhe gaccheyyāvho（你们应当去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1824-37-42", "zh": "Ahaṃ gaccheyyaṃ（我应当去），mayaṃ gaccheyyāmhe（我们应当去）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1824-43-45", "zh": "以上是愿望语气（sattamī）的形式。", "confidence": 80}
